mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{\\upharpoonright}\">\\({\\upharpoonright}\\)</span> (restriction operator)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S\\)</span> (branch-through-sequence-tree predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(b))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\operatorname{dom}(b),X)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\gamma,X))\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;(t{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha\\in T)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(b)\\;(b{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha\\in T)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\operatorname{dom}(b))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\operatorname{dom}(b),X)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\gamma\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\gamma,X))\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\;(t{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha\\in T)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(b)\\;(b{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha\\in T)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"{\\upharp